 .../browser/bare/BareVerticalTabsDrawer.java  |  68 +++-----
 .../bare/BareVerticalTabsDrawerUnitTest.java  | 162 ++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 172 insertions(+), 58 deletions(-)

